{"version":1,"key":"card:59","content":{"id":59,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"今天看了张鑫旭的一个处理图片加载错误处理方法的视频，我觉得很是优雅。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"常见做法"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"监听 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"onerror","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件，当图片加载出错时，触发该事件，然后我们替换为一张兜底图"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"<img src='xxx.png' onerror='this.src=\"break.svg\"' />","language":"HTML","uuid":"4e803c10-2b3f-4895-af78-60111f3e1b6a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"img[src$=\"break.svg\"] {\n  object-fit: contain;\n}","language":"css","uuid":"0c062d42-cdea-4bea-b15a-e8451ebe509e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这样做的缺点是只有一张裂开的图，用户不知道"},{"type":"formatted","text":"这张图表达的含义是什么","highlight":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，对用户而言，内容是比视觉体验重要的。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"基于 CSS 的方法"}],"level":2},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用伪元素 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"::before","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" "},{"type":"formatted","text":"::after","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来展示兜底图和提示内容，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"img","code":true,"highlight":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 有一个特性是能正常加载图片时，","highlight":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"::before","code":true,"highlight":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 ","highlight":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"::after","code":true,"highlight":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是不会显示出来的。","highlight":true}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"<img\n  src=\"zxx.png\"\n  alt=\"提示内容\"\n>","language":"html","uuid":"18bc4441-0a52-4d53-9ed7-23c0eb67c0df","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"note","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一定要写 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"alt","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性。"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"img {\n  position: relative;\n  /* 下面这行的意义是什么 */\n  transform: scale(1); \n}\n\nimg::before {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 0;\n  top: 0;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  background: url(break.svg) no-repeat center / 50% 50% #f5f5f5;\n  color: transparent;\n}\n\nimg::after {\n  content: attr(alt);\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 0;\n  bottom: 0;\n  width: 100%;\n  line-height: 2;\n  background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, .5);\n  color: white;\n  text-align: center;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  text-overflow: ellipsis;\n}","language":"css","uuid":"2d6675e4-4299-44bf-a5b8-50a8c971fae2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"既能呈现视觉效果，也能显示内容。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考"}],"level":2},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://www.zhangxinxu.com/wordpress/2020/10/css-style-image-load-fail/","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"图片加载出错样式最佳实践"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]}],"tags":["CSS/技巧","技巧/CSS"],"createTime":1689002736607,"updateTime":1754033526592,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1754033526592}}